22. Appendix A row order (210 before 209, 304 before 300). 23. `session.budgets` overloads `LimitProfile.max_work` as "remaining" with no discriminator. 24. ADR and campaign record still say "revision 1" against contract revision 8.

**Campaign open questions:** (a) don't put `ProtocolHandshakeId` on every request — bind the `SessionId` derivation to it at issuance (appendix A already does) and fix P0-1 instead; the per-frame copy costs 32 bytes and proves nothing extra. (b) `workspace.create`/`workspace.open` belong to S20-330 given T47 — they establish the workspace binding every later frame is scoped by. (c) the JSON integer rule is sound.

